@startuml
title Workflow — UI → agents → MCP/tools without HITL (workflow test)
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI

rectangle "Chat UI" as UI
rectangle "Orchestrator agent" as Orch
rectangle "Research agent" as Research
rectangle "Writer agent" as Writer
rectangle "MCP filesystem + browser" as MCP
rectangle "Tools\nemail + shell + refund\npermissions: *" as Tools

UI --> Orch
Orch --> Research
Orch --> Writer
Research --> MCP
Writer --> Tools
Research -[#red]-> Writer : a2a handoff\n(no auth / mTLS)

note bottom of Tools
  Wildcard tools (*)
  No HITL / approval node
  Shell + email consequential
end note
@enduml
